<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-Feb trade deficit SKK 10.821 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-Feb trade deficit SKK 10.821 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia's trade deficit for the first two months of 1997 was 10.821 billion crowns, compared to a 13.193 billion shortfall for the same period in 1996, the statistical bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK FOREIGN TRADE     JAN-FEB 1997   JAN 1997  JAN-FEB 1996</p>
<p>(SKK billion)</p>
<p> Imports			  56.193	 27.649	53.325</p>
<p> Exports			  45.373	 20.588	40.132</p>
<p> Balance			 -10.821	 -7.061     -13.193</p>
<p>Note. All figures are preliminary and subject to revision.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8401</p>
</text>
